Every clinician should assess a concurrent-substance-use.
Every clinician should use a state-PDMP-record during a concurrent-substance-use-assessment.
Every clinician should use a toxicology-testing during a concurrent-substance-use-assessment.
If a patient has a concurrent-substance-use then the concurrent-substance-use can increase an opioid-use-disorder-risk for the patient and can increase an overdose-risk for the patient.
